{"title":"Career Roadmap — Design Analyst","role":"Design Analyst","summary":"A Design Analyst uses research, data, visualisation and design thinking to understand problems, identify patterns and communicate insights that support better decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Data Visualisation / Information Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Design Analyst uses research, data, visualisation and design thinking to understand problems, identify patterns and communicate insights that support better decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"For a student specialising in Data Visualisation / Information Design, the role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Visual communication"},{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Decision-making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Design Analyst may analyse customer behaviour, product usage, business performance, public datasets, user research or operational information and then transform complex information into clear visual insights and actionable recommendations."},{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop more than visual-design skills. A competitive profile combines data literacy + analytical thinking + information design + visualisation + business understanding."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Route"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des Data Visualisation / Information Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Data + Information Design Skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analysis / Visualisation Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Design Analyst / Data Visualisation Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Design Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Strategy / Analytics Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Director / Data & Experience Strategy Lead"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Design fundamentals + data literacy"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Information design + visualisation"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Analytics + interactive dashboards"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Strategic analysis + real-world projects"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Design/Data Visualisation Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Design Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Design Analyst / Analytics Designer"}],[{"text":"8+ years"},{"text":"Design Strategy / Analytics Lead"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design & Data Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"The first year should establish both visual communication and analytical thinking."},{"type":"h","text":"Design Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Layout"},{"text":"Information hierarchy"},{"text":"Grid systems"},{"text":"Graphic design"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Data representation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data types"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Categories"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Percentages"},{"text":"Ratios"},{"text":"Mean, median and mode"},{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Basic probability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Adobe Photoshop"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-1 Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Data Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Take a public dataset such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"Population, education, transport or environmental data."},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Basic analysis"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Infographic"},{"text":"Final visual story"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The objective is to learn:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data","Meaning","Visual Communication"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Information Design & Visualisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Year 2 should develop professional information-design capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn Data Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand when to use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bar charts"},{"text":"Line charts"},{"text":"Scatter plots"},{"text":"Histograms"},{"text":"Heat maps"},{"text":"Treemaps"},{"text":"Maps"},{"text":"Area charts"},{"text":"Bubble charts"},{"text":"Network diagrams"},{"text":"Flow diagrams"},{"text":"Timelines"}]},{"type":"p","text":"More importantly, understand when not to use a particular visualisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Information Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information hierarchy"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Cognitive load"},{"text":"Visual perception"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Dashboard layout"},{"text":"Annotation"},{"text":"Labelling"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-2 Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Urban Mobility Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transport modes"},{"text":"Peak hours"},{"text":"Traffic patterns"},{"text":"Travel time"},{"text":"Route usage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research question"},{"text":"Data preparation"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Dashboard"},{"text":"Visual narrative"},{"text":"Design recommendations"}]}]},{"heading":"Data Analysis Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Design Analyst should be comfortable working with data before visualising it."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Duplicates"},{"text":"Filtering"},{"text":"Sorting"},{"text":"Grouping"},{"text":"Aggregation"},{"text":"Calculated fields"},{"text":"Basic statistical analysis"},{"text":"Outlier identification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Become proficient with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Basic formulas"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Window functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Design Analyst who understands SQL can work directly with real organisational datasets."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Analytics & Interactive Visualisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Year 3 should introduce professional analytics workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Interactive visualisation"},{"text":"User behaviour analytics"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Statistical interpretation"},{"text":"A/B testing fundamentals"},{"text":"UX analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Strong options include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Looker Studio"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"R"}]},{"type":"h","text":"A practical stack is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Excel","Power BI/Tableau","Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The student does not need to master every analytics platform."}]},{"heading":"Python for Design Analysts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Python becomes useful for larger datasets and advanced analysis."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Libraries"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Seaborn"},{"text":"Plotly"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Applications"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Statistical summaries"},{"text":"Automated reports"},{"text":"Interactive visualisation"},{"text":"Large dataset processing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"For example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Raw Dataset"},{"type":"h","text":"Python / pandas"},{"type":"h","text":"Clean Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Exploratory Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Patterns"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Insight"}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Strategic Design Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Year 4 should demonstrate that the student can use data to support real decisions, not merely create attractive charts."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design strategy"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"UX analytics"},{"text":"Business intelligence"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Information systems"},{"text":"Decision support"},{"text":"Design metrics"},{"text":"Research synthesis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"h","text":"A strong project could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Data-Driven Analysis of an E-Commerce Customer Journey\""},{"type":"h","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Website traffic"},{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Search behaviour"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Cart abandonment"},{"text":"Repeat purchases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Behavioural Patterns"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Key Insights"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Problems"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommendations"},{"type":"h","text":"Prototype / Improvement"},{"type":"h","text":"Impact Measurement"},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates the connection between analytics and design decisions."}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Data Visualisation"},{"text":"Visual communication of data"}],[{"text":"Information Design"},{"text":"Making complex information understandable"}],[{"text":"Business Intelligence Design"},{"text":"Dashboards + business decisions"}],[{"text":"UX Analytics"},{"text":"User behaviour"}],[{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"Product performance"}],[{"text":"Customer Analytics"},{"text":"Customer behaviour"}],[{"text":"Data Storytelling"},{"text":"Narrative with data"}],[{"text":"Information Architecture"},{"text":"Organising complex information"}],[{"text":"Infographic Design"},{"text":"Static information communication"}],[{"text":"Interactive Visualisation"},{"text":"Dynamic data exploration"}],[{"text":"Geospatial Visualisation"},{"text":"Maps + spatial data"}],[{"text":"Scientific Visualisation"},{"text":"Scientific datasets"}],[{"text":"Public Data Design"},{"text":"Government/social datasets"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools to Learn","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"R"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Looker Studio"},{"text":"Plotly"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"InDesign"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Collaboration"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Miro"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Confluence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Core Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"For an undergraduate, a highly practical combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","SQL","Power BI","Figma","Python"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Design Analyst portfolio should combine analysis and visual communication."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Public Data Story"},{"type":"h","text":"Analyse a public dataset and produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Visualisations"},{"text":"Narrative"},{"text":"Key findings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Business Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Regions"},{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"KPIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — UX Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a fictional or public digital-product dataset."},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Drop-off points"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Retention"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then propose design improvements."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Social Data Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Urban Air Quality Across Indian Cities\""},{"type":"h","text":"Show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geographic patterns"},{"text":"Time trends"},{"text":"Pollution levels"},{"text":"Comparisons"},{"text":"Key insights"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Interactive Data Story"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a scroll-based or interactive story where users progressively discover insights."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Final-Year Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Complete an end-to-end analytical design project using real data."}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Project Structure","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Every project should show:"},{"type":"h","text":"Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Source"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Cleaning"},{"type":"h","text":"Exploration"},{"type":"h","text":"Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Key Pattern"},{"type":"h","text":"Insight"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommendation"},{"type":"h","text":"Expected / Measured Impact"},{"type":"p","text":"This is important because employers need to see how the student reasoned, not just the final dashboard."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analytics companies"},{"text":"Design consultancies"},{"text":"UX research teams"},{"text":"Product companies"},{"text":"Business intelligence teams"},{"text":"Data analytics teams"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Research organisations"},{"text":"Media/data journalism organisations"},{"text":"Fintech companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Technology companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Data Visualisation Intern"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"},{"text":"BI Analyst Intern"},{"text":"UX Research Intern"},{"text":"Product Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Information Designer"},{"text":"Data Storytelling Intern"},{"text":"Research Analyst Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Internship Project","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"\"Customer Behaviour Analytics\""},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a real or approved company dataset."},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Product usage"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Drop-off"},{"text":"Purchase patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Then create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Analytical report"},{"text":"Interactive dashboard"},{"text":"Key insights"},{"text":"Design recommendations"},{"text":"Proposed improvements"},{"text":"Impact measurement framework"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The strongest output is not:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Here is my dashboard.\""},{"type":"h","text":"It is:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Here is the business/design problem, here is the evidence, and here is the decision the evidence supports.\""}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Useful learning areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Python for data analysis"},{"text":"UX research"},{"text":"Information design"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Business analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications can strengthen the profile, but portfolio evidence and analytical ability should remain the priority."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the employer, relevant entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Design Analyst"},{"text":"Design Analyst"},{"text":"Data Visualisation Analyst"},{"text":"Data Analyst"},{"text":"BI Analyst"},{"text":"Information Designer"},{"text":"UX Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Customer Insights Analyst"},{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"Data Storytelling Specialist"},{"text":"Visual Analytics Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With experience:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Design Analyst"},{"text":"Senior Data Visualisation Analyst"},{"text":"Analytics Designer"},{"text":"Product Analytics Lead"},{"text":"Design Strategy Analyst"},{"text":"Data & Design Strategist"}]}]},{"heading":"Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is the difference between qualitative and quantitative data?"},{"text":"How would you clean a dataset?"},{"text":"How do you handle missing values?"},{"text":"What is correlation?"},{"text":"What is the difference between correlation and causation?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you choose a chart for a dataset?"},{"text":"When would you use a bar chart instead of a line chart?"},{"text":"What makes a dashboard effective?"},{"text":"How can a visualisation mislead users?"},{"text":"How would you design an accessible dashboard?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is a KPI?"},{"text":"How would you identify an important business trend?"},{"text":"How would you investigate a sudden drop in conversion?"},{"text":"How would you segment customers?"},{"text":"How would you communicate an unexpected finding to management?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What was the research question?"},{"text":"What data did you use?"},{"text":"How did you clean it?"},{"text":"What was your most important finding?"},{"text":"What decision did your analysis support?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant postgraduate pathways include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Des in Information Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Data Visualisation"},{"text":"M.Des in Interaction Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Information Experience Design"},{"text":"M.Des in Strategic Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Data Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Data Science"},{"text":"MSc Business Intelligence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UX"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HCI"},{"text":"UX Research"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"Human-Centred Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strategy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Design Strategy"},{"text":"Innovation Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For someone wanting a design-heavy career, an information/data visualisation or interaction-design master's may be preferable. For someone wanting a more analytical role, business analytics/data analytics can broaden opportunities."}]},{"heading":"High-Value Specialist Routes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Route A — Data Visualisation"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des Information Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualisation Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Data Visualisation Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualisation Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Visualisation Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Visual Analytics Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Route B — Product Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL + Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Product Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Product Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Analytics Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Route C — UX Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Research + Data"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Analytics Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Research / Analytics Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior UX Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Research & Analytics Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Route D — Design Strategy"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Data + Design Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Strategic Design Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Strategist"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Strategy Lead"}]},{"heading":"Data Ethics & Responsible Visualisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a critical skill for a Design Analyst."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn to recognise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Misleading axes"},{"text":"Cherry-picked data"},{"text":"Inappropriate chart types"},{"text":"Biased samples"},{"text":"Correlation mistaken for causation"},{"text":"Missing context"},{"text":"Privacy risks"},{"text":"Unrepresentative datasets"},{"text":"Accessibility problems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A visually beautiful chart can still communicate a false conclusion."},{"type":"h","text":"The professional standard should be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accurate","Contextual","Accessible","Transparent","Actionable"]}]},{"heading":"AI & Future of Design Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will significantly change data analysis and visualisation workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Students should learn how to use AI for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data exploration"},{"text":"SQL generation"},{"text":"Data cleaning assistance"},{"text":"Pattern discovery"},{"text":"Automated visualisation"},{"text":"Natural-language analytics"},{"text":"Dashboard generation"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Scenario modelling"},{"text":"Report generation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But AI-generated analysis must be validated."},{"type":"p","text":"The future Design Analyst needs to understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Insight"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Decision"},{"type":"p","text":"The valuable skill will increasingly be asking the right question and judging whether the analysis is actually valid."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Directions","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information Design"},{"text":"Data Visualisation"},{"text":"Information Experience Design"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"},{"text":"HCI"},{"text":"Design Strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Potential destinations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Denmark"},{"text":"Sweden"},{"text":"Finland"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Students should compare programmes based on data labs, industry projects, visualisation research, interdisciplinary coursework and portfolio opportunities."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"B.Des Graduate"},{"type":"h","text":"Data/Design Research Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Design Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Design Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics / Design Strategy Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Design & Data Strategy Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative:"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualisation Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Visualisation Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Visual Analytics Specialist"},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Data & Design Strategy Lead"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information design"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Dashboard UX"},{"text":"Visual communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"KPI analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Python/Plotly"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"},{"text":"Infographics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Basic APIs/data sources"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business understanding"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Critical thinking"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"},{"text":"Decision-making"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted analytics"},{"text":"Natural-language BI"},{"text":"Automated visualisation"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Data ethics"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate profile should look like:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Data Visualisation/Information Design","Statistics","Excel","SQL","Power BI/Tableau","Python","Figma","Information Design","Data Storytelling","4–6 Real-Data Projects","Internship","Strong Analytical Portfolio"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 1","text":"Design fundamentals + statistics + Excel\nYear 2: Information design + visualisation + data storytelling\nYear 3: SQL + Power BI/Tableau + Python + analytics\nYear 4: Strategic analytics + real-world project + internship\nAfter graduation: Junior Design/Data Visualisation Analyst\n3–5 years: Design Analyst / Data Visualisation Analyst\n5–8 years: Senior Analyst / Analytics Designer\n8+ years: Analytics Lead / Design Strategy Lead"},{"type":"note","label":"Key point","text":"The strongest candidate is not simply someone who creates attractive dashboards. They can frame the right question, work with imperfect data, analyse it correctly, choose an appropriate visual representation, communicate the insight clearly and connect that insight to a real design or business decision."}]}]}